'''Golpar''' is a [[Farming]] plant used in the [[Chambers of Xeric]] and grown at level 27 Farming. Golpar is grown by planting a [[golpar seed]] in a [[Chambers of Xeric]] [[herb patch]]. A [[seed dibber]] is needed to plant the seed.
After 30 seconds, the planted seed will become [[Golpar]]. 

Planting the Golpar seeds gives 4 farming experience.

Each Golpar, when picked, gives 10 farming experience. The Golpar do not grow back after they are picked. The Golpar may be picked after the plant is completely grown.
